OL,3,GNEWSALondon's urgent race to make AI   
OL,4,Asafer                                  
OL,6,FIncreasingly described as Europe's     
OL,7,Fleading AI hub, London is home to      
OL,8,FGoogle DeepMind, while Anthropic has   
OL,9,Falso established a major base in the   
OL,10,Fcapital.                               
OL,12,FAccording to the London AI Hub, a      
OL,13,Fco-working space and community for AI  
OL,14,Fentrepreneurs, up to 50 organisations  
OL,15,Fin the capital now focus on AI safety. 
